@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> AccountCreation : Create an account

state StartChoice <<choice>>
StartChoice --> AccountCreation : Create an account
StartChoice --> VideoWatching : Watch videos (after account creation)

state AccountCreation
AccountCreation --> AccountCreated : Account created successfully
AccountCreation --> VideoWatching : Watch videos (without creating account)

state AccountCreated
AccountCreated --> VideoWatching : Watch videos

state VideoWatching
VideoWatching --> SaveVideo : Save video in likes list
VideoWatching --> DiscussionOption : Enter discussion option

state SaveVideo
SaveVideo --> SavedVideosList : View saved videos from likes list

state DiscussionOption
DiscussionOption --> DiscussionEntry : Enter the discussion

state SavedVideosList <<choice>>
SavedVideosList --> VideoWatching : Back to watching videos

state DiscussionEntry <<choice>>
DiscussionEntry --> VideoWatching : Back to watching videos

[*] --> [*] : Completion event

@enduml
